{"itchsRODTEPDtlsDTO":null,"notes":[{"noteId":3.33000284E8,"noteName":"Sub-Heading","noteDetails":[{"notetype":"Sub-Heading","policyType":"IMPORT","chapter":"80","noteSerialNo":"1","notes":"<p style=\"text-align:justify\">In this Chapter, the following expressions have the meanings hereby assigned to them:</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(a) Tin, not alloyed Metal containing by weight at least 99% of tin, provided that the content by weight of any bismuth or copper is less than the limit specified in the following Table: TABLE &ndash; OTHER ELEMENTS Element Limiting content % by weight Bi BISMUTH 0.1 Cu COPPER 0.4</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(b) Tin alloys Metallic substances in which tin predominates by weight over each of the other elements, provided that:</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(i) the total content by weight of such other elements exceeds 1%; or&nbsp;</p>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:justify\">(ii) the content by weight of either bismuth or copper is equal to or greater than the limit specified in the foregoing table</p>\n","notificationNo":null,"notificationDate":null,"noteSection":"XV"}],"noteSectionDetails":[]}],"itcCodeClassifications":[{"itcCodeId":null,"unitOfMeasure":null,"itcCode":"8001","itcDescription":"Unwrought tin.","itchswco":"","impPolicy":"","impItcCodeType":"YES","impCondition":"","expPolicy":null,"expItcCodeType":null,"expCondition":null,"notificationNo":"","notificationDate":""},{"itcCodeId":null,"unitOfMeasure":null,"itcCode":"800110","itcDescription":"Tin, not alloyed","itchswco":" -","impPolicy":"","impItcCodeType":"YES","impCondition":"","expPolicy":null,"expItcCodeType":null,"expCondition":null,"notificationNo":"","notificationDate":""},{"itcCodeId":null,"unitOfMeasure":null,"itcCode":"80011010","itcDescription":"Blocks","itchswco":" ---","impPolicy":"Free","impItcCodeType":"YES","impCondition":"","expPolicy":null,"expItcCodeType":null,"expCondition":null,"notificationNo":"","notificationDate":""},{"itcCodeId